---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Writing
description: Notes and essays on distributed deep learning, AI for science, and agentic harnesses for science, by Shehtab Zaman.
---
<div class="page-intro">
  <h1>Writing</h1>
  <p>Notes and essays on building AI systems for scientific work. Organized into ongoing series, with room to follow an idea over several posts.</p>
</div>
{% for item in writingSeries %}
{% set posts = collections.posts | inSeries(item.id) %}
{% if posts.length %}
<section aria-labelledby="{{ item.id }}">
  <h2 id="{{ item.id }}"><a href="/writing/{{ item.id }}/">{{ item.title }}</a></h2>
  <p>{{ item.description }}</p>
  {% include "post-list.njk" %}
</section>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% set posts = collections.posts | inSeries('') %}
{% if posts.length %}<section><h2>Other notes</h2>{% include "post-list.njk" %}</section>{% endif %}
{% if collections.posts.length %}<p class="meta">Follow new posts with <a href="/feed.xml">RSS / Atom</a>.</p>{% endif %}
